{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0284_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c02eabec6f650238b5ca10c07819ff6e177a798b6ceabbf736a1bc7611595ef6", "ja": "（やよいの曲に合わせた新しい衣装が完成した。\n試着は終わったみたいだし、様子を覗いてみるか）", "zh": "（配合弥生歌曲的新服装完成了。试穿似乎已经结束了，要不要去看看她现在的样子呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0284_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "6268129802b37dff9c73c3dd157a598f2557ed935e9848501ee0f58402039e3e", "ja": "ちちんぷいぷい～ポッピンナウ……\nワン、ツー、スリー！", "zh": "变变变～现在蹦出来……  \n一、二、三！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0284_1002_p", "source_sha256": "df0e24ab43db4a8e8c682da8cad1ea0a135518b766327735ebc7112dd96cb4a0", "ja": "………………。\nお疲れさま。もしかしてマジックの練習中か？", "zh": "………………。\n辛苦了。你难道是在练魔术吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0284_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "ef6d308a7ddbae79740af621caacfe9bfaaefc4a89e97d771ff6c223c70ae914", "ja": "はわっ！？　{$P$}！\nえっと……魔法の呪文の練習です！", "zh": "哈哇！？{$P$}！\n那个……我在练习魔法咒语！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0284_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "ae71c38e1974e0d8ea9255586ff45667413db3b612b18b9a73a39f93dbf918be", "ja": "MC中に魔法使いっぽく唱えてみたら、\nファンのみんなが喜んでくれるかなーって！", "zh": "我想着要是能在主持串场时像魔法使那样念出来，\n粉丝大家会不会觉得很高兴呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0284_1005_p", "source_sha256": "044d43ad79208b52d2f925eed800dd8313c106d98249a85a7c3129708dd2d45d", "ja": "なるほど、それでさっきの呪文か。\n衣装にも合ってるし、いいアイディアだと思うぞ！", "zh": "原来如此，所以刚才才念了那个咒语啊。和服装也很相配，我觉得是个不错的主意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0284_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "90baa993887cf1f03d7baa0c6bf420dc180ace03ce4dabd6e854a9efee8afe71", "ja": "いぇい！　よかったです！　みんながたくさん\nコメントをくれたから張り切っちゃいました！", "zh": "耶！太好了！因为大家给了好多评论，\n我就干劲十足地做起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0284_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8c33f54ccdbc93e212845f764f6566dadcea4122883bb0d1da63d15f197bf918", "ja": "コメント？　あ、ブログか。たしかに「魔法少女だ！」\nとか「かわいい！」とか、盛り上がってたもんな。", "zh": "评论？啊，是博客啊。确实，大家都热烈讨论着“是魔法少女！”、“好可爱！”之类的话嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0284_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "85331d7f251e1c79b524a09bd763e0511e09bed5725bd4edc98c353a5142ab7a", "ja": "みんなやっぱり、魔法が大好きなんですね！\nうちの妹と弟たちも大好きですし。", "zh": "大家果然都很喜欢魔法呢！\n我家里的弟弟妹妹们也特别喜欢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0284_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4abae5910b8a34f622e1b7ce669e2696c1a7489579ad9b42b9595cc2027964e4", "ja": "まぁ、やっぱり憧れはあるよな。\nやよいも、使ってみたい魔法はあるだろ？", "zh": "也是，毕竟都会憧憬魔法呢。\n弥生你也有想用用看的魔法吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0284_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "3217eee9f95d7860cafdc80fe16c34d2cc6412fa2738e081f452de4f43c9735c", "ja": "はいっ！　スーパーのセール情報がわかったり、\n消費税が計算できたら便利かなーって！", "zh": "是！要是能知道超市的促销信息，或者算出消费税，就方便了呢——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0284_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f293134c43f23b808a80e4236636145b42279c2ebebab2f7dbdac07ab167cf7d", "ja": "（スマホじゃダメなのだろうか）", "zh": "（用手机不就好了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0284_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "26979dbd787b05a0774d2c278f74ce698ca28946dbae413449b056fe8aa7c500", "ja": "あと、みんなの好きなものとか、\n食べたいものがわかる魔法が使えたら……", "zh": "还有，要是能使用知道大家喜欢的东西、想吃的东西的魔法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
